Package: okular
Version: @DEB_OKULAR_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://okular.kde.org/
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-svg, kf6-archive, kf6-bookmarks, kf6-completion, kf6-config, kf6-configwidgets, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-i18n, kf6-kio, kf6-parts, kf6-colorscheme, kf6-crash, kf6-iconthemes, kf6-itemviews, kf6-textwidgets, kf6-widgetsaddons, kf6-windowsystem, kf6-xmlgui, kf6-threadweaver, libpoppler140, libpoppler-qt6-3, libfreetype6
Description: Okular document viewer (Qt6/KF6)
 Okular is KDE's document viewer. This iOS build is a first-pass desktop
 package focused on PDF support through Poppler Qt6, with optional backends
 such as EPUB, DjVu, TIFF, markdown, speech, and media disabled for a smaller
 and more portable package.
